{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10271030","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10271030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1027103001:0":{"text":"迪恩叔叔，我看园子里还有不少空地，要不要试验性地种点作物？","source_cn":"迪恩叔叔，我看园子里还有不少空地，要不要试验性地种点作物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x214C67D654250AED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027103002:0":{"text":"萤瓤果和跳跳豆就很不错！萤瓤果可以榨糖，跳跳豆不但可以炒来吃，还可以做弹弓的弹丸……","source_cn":"萤瓤果和跳跳豆就很不错！萤瓤果可以榨糖，跳跳豆不但可以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39C8F40BF85A364B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027103003:1":{"text":"……就是有点废牙！","source_cn":"……就是有点废牙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x565EE72DC8380721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027103004:0":{"text":"你这孩子，又在出什么坏点子？不会有新发明要用到那些果子吧？","source_cn":"你这孩子，又在出什么坏点子？不会有新发明要用到那些果子吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68B945B84BCB4313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027103005:0":{"text":"也对，也不对。确实要用，而且用量很大——超级大！！","source_cn":"也对，也不对。确实要用，而且用量很大——超级大！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9DBD8D851E60127","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docume